Except for the permissions expressly granted here, redistribution of the module or modified versions, sharing protected download access, and reuse of its code or files are not permitted without separate written permission.

Third-party components retain their own licences. Nothing in this licence restricts rights granted by those licences or rights that applicable law does not allow to be restricted.
